MojoProof GPU run record of ldmatrix: notice for the files in tests/gpu/ldmatrix/

test_ldmatrix.mojo is a modified copy of max/kernels/test/gpu/layout/test_ldmatrix.mojo in
https://github.com/modular/modular at commit bbc13a719b6c139ede763f1434a4342ebfd843ac
(bbc13a71). It keeps Modular's header, which reads:

    Copyright (c) 2026, Modular Inc. All rights reserved.

    Licensed under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions:
    https://llvm.org/LICENSE.txt

and says in a comment what was changed: the imports of its origin are kept, and its kernels,
runners and `main` are replaced by a one-warp kernel around the library's `ld_matrix` and a
`main` that runs it on random shared words and row addresses and writes the dump. The license
text is in tests/corpus/LICENSE-APACHE-LLVM.

record.txt, dump.txt and Compare.lean are this repository's, under its license.
